Keymotion (https://github.com/cebersaban44-rgb/keymotion), Apache-2.0 OR MIT:
only protocol facts were taken from its documentation and source comments, no code was copied:
  * the keyboard's macro memory limit, (steps + macros) * 8 <= 0xA8C bytes
  * the rule that the Fn key must never be remapped
  * the weekday byte (offset 10, 0 = Sunday) of the clock packet
